==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[intentional]] [[walk]]}}

# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} The intentional [[pitch]]ing of four [[ball]]s (bad pitches), or of a fourth ball, in order to give the [[batter]] a [[walk]] (for example, so as to avoid the risk of a [[home run]]).
#: ''Jones was given an '''intentional walk''' in order to face Smith.''

